Wayfinder adaptation provenance

Adapted from:
https://github.com/mattpocock/skills/tree/main/skills/engineering/wayfinder

Pinned upstream revision:
38d62e71ed01fc05d5ae63b0807172e9546049d5

The adaptation is self-contained for the Engineering Workflows Codex plugin and adds
explicit authority boundaries, local and GitHub tracker adapters, deterministic
claim arbitration, append-only map events, and concurrency-safe resolution gates.

